<infoparam name="UML Note" value="
The system adressed by the model was first described by Prof. Ludovic Apvrille in 2007.
The solution posted on soc.eurecom.fr/UMLEmb/exams.html used TTool and TAU G2, 
using the TURTLE and UML/SDL profiles, respectively.
The model included in this file exclusively uses the SysML/AVATAR syntax and TTool.


Last Update: September 21, 2021.

Authors
 Pierre de Saqui-Sannes
 pdss@isae-supaero.fr

 Ludovic Apvrille
 ludovic.apvrille@telecom-paristech.fr
 
" />
